flowchart LR
    subgraph External["External and supporting boundaries"]
        IGDB["IGDB external catalogue context"]
        IdP["External Identity Provider"]
        Telemetry["Telemetry platform"]
    end

    subgraph Product["VideoGame Platform modular monolith"]
        Catalogue["Catalogue and Releases<br/><br/>Games, aliases, platforms, regions,<br/>releases, covers, provenance,<br/>freshness and synchronization"]
        EligibilityContract["Narrow Catalogue application contract<br/>Rating eligibility evidence"]
        Ratings["Ratings<br/><br/>Personal rating lifecycle,<br/>eligibility, aggregate policy<br/>and Mis puntuaciones"]
        ACL["IGDB adapter / Anti-Corruption Layer"]
        IdentityAdapter["Identity adapter<br/>issuer + subject → UserId"]
        Observability["Observability adapter<br/>technical capability"]
    end

    IGDB -->|Raw provider data| ACL
    ACL -->|Provider-independent candidates| Catalogue

    Catalogue -->|Publishes| EligibilityContract
    Ratings -->|Queries; never reads Catalogue tables| EligibilityContract

    IdP -->|Authenticated issuer + subject| IdentityAdapter
    IdentityAdapter -->|Stable UserId| Ratings

    Catalogue -.->|Emits technical signals| Observability
    Ratings -.->|Emits technical signals| Observability
    Observability -.->|Exports logs, metrics and traces| Telemetry


